UID:164742@iso-ne.com
DTSTAMP:20260824T070340Z
DTSTART:20260804T170200Z
SUMMARY:FTR Reassignments of PNode 46728\, 46729\, 46730\, 612 effective August 6th\, 2026
DESCRIPTION:As a result of the retirement of LD.2121A_T 34.5 (46728)\, LD.STICKNEY34.5 (46729)\, LD.UNION   34.5 (46730) and UN.WATER_RV23  W_J1 (612)\, active FTRs awarded at the PNodes will be reassigned.\n\nAdditional information can be found on the Financial Transmission Rights webpage.\nhttps://www.iso-ne.com/event-details?eventId=164742
URL:https://www.iso-ne.com/event-details?eventId=164742
END:VEVENT
