UID:164750@iso-ne.com
DTSTAMP:20260824T070340Z
DTSTART:20260806T130000Z
SUMMARY:Pricing-Node Table Revisions Effective Thursday August 06\, 2026
DESCRIPTION:On Thursday\, August 06\, 2026\, the following PNodes will be removed from the New England Marketplace: Deactivated PNodes 46728\, 46729\, 46730\, 612\n\nA revised version of the PNode table is available on ISO-NE's website.\nhttps://www.iso-ne.com/event-details?eventId=164750
URL:https://www.iso-ne.com/event-details?eventId=164750
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:160081@iso-ne.com
DTSTAMP:20260824T070340Z
DTSTART:20260806T140000Z
DTEND:20260806T183000Z
SUMMARY:NEPOOL Participants Committee Meeting
LOCATION:Virtual WebEx Meeting
DESCRIPTION:NEPOOL meetings\, while not public\, are open to all NEPOOL Participants\, their authorized representatives and\, except as otherwise limited for discussions in executive session\, consumer advocates\, federal and state officials and guests whose attendance has been cleared with the Committee Chair. All those in attendance or participating\, either in person or by phone\, are required to identify themselves and their affiliation at the meeting. Official records and minutes of meetings are posted publicly. No statements made in NEPOOL meetings are to be quoted or published publicly.\n\nAdd to My Calendar\nhttps://www.iso-ne.com/event-details?eventId=160081
URL:https://www.iso-ne.com/event-details?eventId=160081
END:VEVENT
