DTSTAMP:20260824T070340Z
DTSTART:20260807T130000Z
SUMMARY:M/LCC 2 Implemented on Friday\, August 07\, 2026 at 09:00 in ALL OF NEW ENGLAND
DESCRIPTION:ISO New England is implementing Master Local Control Center Procedure No. 2 (M/LCC 2)\, Abnormal Conditions Alert\, on Friday\, August 07\, 2026 at 09:00 in ALL OF NEW ENGLAND due to Capacity Deficiency.  Master Local Control Center Procedure No. 2 requests that you will not engage in activities that may jeopardize the availability of resources or transmission under your control.\nhttps://www.iso-ne.com/event-details?eventId=164772
URL:https://www.iso-ne.com/event-details?eventId=164772
END:VEVENT
