BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:164798@iso-ne.com
DTSTAMP:20260824T070340Z
DTSTART:20260810T104300Z
SUMMARY:Web Services Sandbox Available August 10\, 2026\, for Day-Ahead Ancillary Services Strike Price and Reserve Reports End Points and Properties
DESCRIPTION:As of August 10\, 2026\, the web services sandbox is available for participants to test updates to the Day-Ahead Ancillary Services Strike Prices and Day-Ahead Hourly Reserve Requirements\, Prices\, Designations\, and Forecast extensible markup language (XML) reports. These updates are related to FERC Docket No. ER26-3176-000\; Revisions to ISO New England Inc. Transmission\, Markets\, and Services Tariff to Adjust Parameters for the Day-Ahead Ancillary Services Market.\n\nThe updates are made available in the sandbox ahead of the ruling to allow time for testing the updates prior to go-live. Refer to the Web Services Sandbox Available August 6\, 2026\, for Day-Ahead Ancillary Services Strike Price and Reserve Reports End Points and Properties knowledge article in Ask ISO for more information.\nhttps://www.iso-ne.com/event-details?eventId=164798
URL:https://www.iso-ne.com/event-details?eventId=164798
END:VEVENT
