BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:164894@iso-ne.com
DTSTAMP:20260824T070340Z
DTSTART:20260818T180000Z
SUMMARY:ISO New England will conduct an outage of SMD Settlement Applications on 08/18/2026\, from 14:00 to 16:00. for software maintenance.
DESCRIPTION:ISO New England will conduct an outage of SMD Settlement Applications on 08/18/2026\, from 14:00 to 16:00. for software maintenance.\n\nDuring the outage\, users will not be able to connect to the following SMD Applications: Internal Transactions\, Submit Meter Reading\, Submit Peak Contribution\, and Submit Monthly Regional Network Load.\n\nThe Financial Assurance Management application will also be unavailable.\n\nMIS Operational reports are delayed.\nhttps://www.iso-ne.com/event-details?eventId=164894
URL:https://www.iso-ne.com/event-details?eventId=164894
END:VEVENT
