SUMMARY:ISO New England will be taking a maintenance outage of various SMD Applications in Sandbox environments\, on Thursday\, August 20\, 2026\, from 14:00 to 16:00 Hrs
DESCRIPTION:ISO New England will be taking a maintenance outage of various SMD Applications in Sandbox environments\, on Thursday\, August 20\, 2026\, from 14:00 to 16:00 Hrs. During the outage\, users will not be able to connect to the following applications in Sandbox environments: eMarket\, eFTR\, DRMUI\, NEXTT\, Internal Transactions\, Submit Meter Reading\, Submit Peak Contribution\, Submit Monthly Regional Network Load\, Submit Energy Inventory\, Forward Reserve Market Auction\, Forward Reserve Assignment and Financial Assurance Management.\nhttps://www.iso-ne.com/event-details?eventId=164918
