SUMMARY:October 2026 FTR Bidding Window to Open
DESCRIPTION:The bidding window for the October 2026 FTR Prompt Auction and Balance of Planning Period will open on September 15\, 2026 (00:00) and will close on September 17\, 2026 (11:00 AM). The October 2026 FTR Auction results will be posted by September 30\, 2026. Registered FTR customers will find assumptions and related information for this auction posted on the FTR Assumptions page available by link from eFTR. For additional information\, please see the eFTR User Guide and ISO New England Manual for Financial Transmission Rights\, M-06\nhttps://www.iso-ne.com/event-details?eventId=164929
