SUMMARY:Consumer Liaison Group Meeting
LOCATION:Clarion Hotel Portland Maine (1230 Congress Street\, Portland\, ME 04102)
DESCRIPTION:Stakeholder forum between ISO New England and regional consumer organizations and advocates to exchange information about the economic impacts of New England’s bulk power system and wholesale electricity markets.\n\nThis meeting will be held both in-person and virtually.\n\nRegister to attend this meeting in-person.\n\nTo attend the meeting virtually\, please add the meeting details to your calendar\, or join from the link below at 12:30 p.m. on September 24. More meeting details can also be found on the event website.\n\nAdd to My Calendar\n\nWebEx link: https://iso-newengland.webex.com/iso-newengland/j.php?MTID=m8916237e2ab5641c2250786d92bb354d\n\nPassword: CLG26!Sept\n\nTeleconference Info: 1-650-479-3208 / Access Code: 2433 643 4503 / Password: 25426073\nhttps://www.iso-ne.com/event-details?eventId=159983
URL:https://www.iso-ne.com/event-details?eventId=159983
END:VEVENT
