BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:160379@iso-ne.com
DTSTAMP:20260824T070340Z
DTSTART:20261027T120000Z
DTEND:20261027T200000Z
SUMMARY:Navigating the Energy Markets (NavEM) in New England (Day 1 of 3)
LOCATION:ISO New England\, 1 Sullivan Road\, Holyoke\, MA 01040 [Connecticut Training Room\, Sullivan South (2nd floor)]
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a comprehensive three-day\, hands-on course designed to delve into advanced topics in New England’s energy market. This course is open to all power industry professionals seeking a deeper understanding of energy market operations and complexities. It is highly recommended that anyone wishing to take this course complete the New England’s Wholesale Energy Market course prior to enrolling. \n\nSave the Date! Registration will be available approximately eight weeks before the class.\nContact: Market Training (MkTraining@iso-ne.com)\nhttps://www.iso-ne.com/event-details?eventId=160379
URL:https://www.iso-ne.com/event-details?eventId=160379
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:160380@iso-ne.com
DTSTAMP:20260824T070340Z
DTSTART:20261028T120000Z
DTEND:20261028T200000Z
SUMMARY:Navigating the Energy Markets (NavEM) in New England (Day 2 of 3)
LOCATION:ISO New England\, 1 Sullivan Road\, Holyoke\, MA 01040 [Connecticut Training Room\, Sullivan South (2nd floor)]
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a comprehensive three-day\, hands-on course designed to delve into advanced topics in New England’s energy market. This course is open to all power industry professionals seeking a deeper understanding of energy market operations and complexities. It is highly recommended that anyone wishing to take this course complete the New England’s Wholesale Energy Market course prior to enrolling. \n\nSave the Date! Registration will be available approximately eight weeks before the class.\nContact: Market Training (MkTraining@iso-ne.com)\nhttps://www.iso-ne.com/event-details?eventId=160380
URL:https://www.iso-ne.com/event-details?eventId=160380
END:VEVENT
